on="rename-current">Rename</button></div><p class="subhead" style="font-size:10px;margin-top:12px">Battle deck: ${total}/60 cards. Deck capacity: 150. Special cards (life, wish, blessing, curse, gamble, revive) are counted separately above.</p></section><section class="deck-panel"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><div><span class="eyebrow">CARD INVENTORY</span><h2 style="margin-top:5px">Add cards</h2></div><span class="count-label">${total} / 150 IN DECK</span></div><div class="deck-card-list">${ALL_CARDS.filter(c=>ownedCount(c.id)>0).map(c=>`<div class="deck-card-row"><span class="mini-glyph" style="color:${c.color}">${c.glyph}</span><div><b>${c.name}</b><small>${c.kind==='utility'?c.category:c.type} · ${ownedCount(c.id)} owned</small></div><span class="card-count">${d.cards[c.id]||0}</span><button data-deck-card="${c.id}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="Remove ${c.name}">−</button><button data-deck-card="${c.id}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Add ${c.name}">＋</button></div>`).join('')}</div></section></div>`}
function renderBattle(){if(!battle)return `<div class="cards-page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">QUICK MATCH · ${selectedMode.toUpperCase()}</span><h1>Battle arena</h1><p class="subhead">Choose your fighter, take a turn, and see who comes out on top.</p></div><button class="secondary" data-view="lobby">← Lobby</button></div><section class="battle-arena" style="display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center"><div><span style="font-size:45px">⚔️</span><h2 style="margin:12px">Ready when you are?</h2><p class="subhead" style="margin:8px 0 18px">Your active deck is <b style="color:var(--text)">${state.decks.find(x=>x.id===state.activeDeck)?.name||'First Encounter'}</b></p><button class="primary" data-action="start-battle">Start a battle</button></div></section>`;const p=getCard(battle.player.id),e=getCard(battle.enemy.id);return `<div class="cards-page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">${battle.over?'MATCH COMPLETE':'QUICK MATCH · '+(battle.mode||selectedMode).toUpperCase()}</span><h1>${battle.over?(battle.won?'A brilliant victory!':'Try again, challenger.'):'Battle arena'}</h1><p class="subhead">${battle.over?'Every great story deserves another round.':`Turn ${battle.turn} · Choose a card to make your move.`}</p></div><button class="secondary" data-view="lobby">← Lobby</button></div><section class="battle-arena"><div class="battle-top"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR TEAM</span><span class="turn-pill">${battle.over?'FINAL SCORE':'TURN '+battle.turn}</span><span class="eyebrow">RIVAL</span></div><div class="battle-field">${fighterMarkup(p,battle.player.hp,battle.player.maxHp)}<div class="vs">${battle.over?(battle.won?'✦':'×'):'VS'}</div>${fighterMarkup(e,battle.enemy.hp,battle.enemy.maxHp)}</div><div class="battle-hand">${battle.over?`<button class="primary" data-action="start-battle">Play again</button>`:`<button class="hand-card" data-action="attack"><span class="hand-icon">⚔️</span><b>${p.attackName}</b><small>Attack · ${p.attack} dmg</small></button>${battle.hand.map(id=>{let c=getCard(id);return c?`<button class="hand-card" data-play-card="${id}"><span class="hand-icon">${c.glyph}</span><b>${c.name}</b><small>${c.description}</small></button>`:''}).join('')}`}</div><div class="battle-log">${battle.log}</div>${battle.over?`<div class="battle-controls"><button class="secondary" data-view="collection">View collection</button><button class="secondary" data-view="lobby">Return to lobby</button></div>`:''}</section>`}
function fighterMarkup(c,hp,max){return `<div class="fighter"><div class="card-art" style="--accent:${c.color}"><span class="card-glyph">${c.glyph}</span></div><h3>${c.name}</h3><small>${c.type} · Weak to ${c.weakness}</small><div class="hp-wrap"><div class="hp-label"><span>❤ HP</span><span>${Math.max(0,hp)} / ${max}</span></div><div class="hp-track"><span style="width:${Math.max(0,hp)/max*100}%"></span></div></div></div>`}

